            "review_title": "Review at Gau Kafe",
            "review_text": "jackieho\nDa Nang, Vietnam10 contributions\n0\nAn Absolute Gem for Coffee and Paninis!\nJul 2026 • Friends\nAn Absolute Gem for Coffee and Paninis! ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐If you are looking for a perfect breakfast or a cozy spot to unwind, Gấu Kafe is a must-visit.The coffee here is exceptional—rich, aromatic, and perfectly brewed with a smooth, lingering aftertaste. Pair your drink with one of their freshly toasted paninis (Vietnamese-style sandwiches/bread). The crust is incredibly crispy, the fillings are generous and flavorful, and everything is served piping hot.Beyond the menu, the cafe offers a charming, warm, and peaceful atmosphere with lovely decor. The staff are absolutely wonderful—friendly, quick, and highly attentive. Fair prices for top-notch quality. I will definitely be back!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThe Coffee: Rich, bold flavor, smooth aftertaste, and premium roasted beans.The Bread/Panini: Perfectly crispy crust, generous fillings, and\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 5, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
